   "annotation_text": "Adverse events related to fulvestrant and/or everolimus/placebo will be followed for 30 days after the last dose of study therapy (fulvestrant and/or everolimus/placebo) or until ≤ grade 1 or if the grade is >1, the event must be permanent and stable. Please note- Serious adverse events >30 days after last dose of fulvestrant and/or everolimus/placebo are not reported unless the event may be related to everolimus/placebo.",
